id: heavy-suppression-overwhelming-mutant
name: Overwhelming Mutant
order: 2
slot: trait
description: >
  As you shed layers of suppression like dead scales, your peerless power shines brighter, overwhelming any foe.
text: >
  Overwhelming Mutant: As you shed layers of suppression like dead scales, your peerless power shines brighter, overwhelming any foe.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you possess 2+ stacks of Power, increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1/2 of S(T).
  (2)-[Triggered/Power]: You may spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to gain an additional stack of Power from this use of the Power Up Maneuver.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: At the end of your turn, spend all stacks of Overwhelm to regain 3(bT) Life Points for each stack spent.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: At the end of your turn, do not trigger the 2nd effect of Overwhelming Fighter.

---

# (1) 2+ stacks of Power: Wound and Soak 1/2 of S(T).
[passive, effect 1]
if (power.stacks >= 2) {
    wound += floor($S / 2) * 1(T);
    soakValue += floor($S / 2) * 1(T);
}

# (2)-(4) Overwhelm spent: the table's.
